	(text "U11: budget 0.35W; solder EP to GND copper / thermal vias at layout.\nU13: AV budget 2.7W; effective junction-to-ambient <=20 C/W, heatsink required.\nC46+C57 / C48+C58 directly at IN pins; C47/C49 at OUT pins.\nNR/SS100n; CFF10n each; keep CS VD+ tied to VA+. Local GND shares P68 power 0V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0418354b-b76b-56ed-b316-c71f9c3c32b7")
	)
	(text "TPS feedback: + arm (22k+10k)/10k -> +4.990V; - arm (22k+10k+10k)/10k -> -4.998V.\nNegative lower arm returns to BUF (pin8), NOT GND. EN tied to +15V; EP11 tied to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1c7d361b-74ba-565b-a761-123ce202ca99")
	)
	(text "Nominal trip magnitudes: 13.75V / 13.75V / 4.25V / 4.1625V.\nNegative sense ratios unchanged; D7 dual diode clamp asymmetric shutdown.\n+/-5V monitors detect collapse, not full CS supply compliance. Require 500ms stable rearm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 269.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "85764f87-76fd-5a28-8c57-769bf1dc7f59")
	)
	(text "SELV ONLY: externally regulated +/-15V input, NEVER P68 high-voltage power rails.\nNominal +/-15V; maximum +/-15.75V. Supply rating >=350mA positive / >=100mA negative."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8aa2e555-0ac5-5909-9bfa-556f76a61208")
	)
